<title>JAPAN: Hokko Chemical - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Hokko Chemical - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to May 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 27.99		vs	   27.74</p>
<p> Operating	  637    million	  vs	  670    million</p>
<p> Current	    591    million	  vs	  527    million</p>
<p> Net		  240    million	  vs	  227    million</p>
<p> EPS		    8.01 yen	  vs	    7.59 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     30 million	  vs	  30 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Hokko Chemical Industry Co Ltd is a specialist manufacturer of agrochemicals.</p>
